   <div class="col"><div style="font-size:12.5pt;font-weight:700;margin-bottom:2.5mm">Recorded change</div><p class="grey" style="font-size:8.8pt">2017: orchard with tracks → 2026: plotted layout, road grid and about 20 houses.<br>Imagery 2017 / 2026; WorldCover 2021: {{'%.0f'|format(lc.site.Cropland)}}% cropland.<br>No heritage mapped on site; waste site planned 2.4 km NE.</p></div>
